  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    49.4,
    59.9,
    335.1,
    73.1
   ],
   "text": "MARITIME BOUNDARYLINE ON OCTOBER 26,2018",
   "conf": 0.99,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    143.4,
    89.8,
    515.2,
    103.0
   ],
   "text": "primary duty is to maintain safety on the bridge and in good visibility and no",
   "conf": 0.9971,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    142.6,
    103.4,
    398.0,
    117.0
   ],
   "text": "traffic may be directed to make rounds of the vessel.",
   "conf": 0.9797,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    106.0,
    126.1,
    541.1,
    140.1
   ],
   "text": "4.3.8. Aboard the ATTESSA IV, the Furuno 2127 X-band radar was installed on August",
   "conf": 0.9902,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    143.4,
    140.1,
    521.6,
    155.3
   ],
   "text": "18, 2011 and the Furuno 2137 S-band radar was installed on August 23, 2011.",
   "conf": 0.995,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    143.0,
    156.1,
    537.1,
    169.7
   ],
   "text": "They were serviced on November 23, 2011. On September 10, 2018, a technician",
   "conf": 0.9928,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    143.0,
    171.7,
    534.7,
    183.6
   ],
   "text": "switched the placement of the radars, putting the X-band on the starboard side of",
   "conf": 0.9936,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    142.6,
    184.8,
    413.2,
    199.6
   ],
   "text": "the bridge and the S-band on the port side of the bridge.",
   "conf": 0.9938,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    105.6,
    207.2,
    535.5,
    222.4
   ],
   "text": "4.3.9. The on-scene weather approximately one hour after the collision was recorded as",
   "conf": 0.9973,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    142.2,
    222.4,
    501.6,
    235.9
   ],
   "text": "6nm visibility, westerly two foot swell and wind speed of two knots. Both",
   "conf": 0.9972,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    143.0,
    237.9,
    431.5,
    251.1
   ],
   "text": "operators stated the weather was good prior to the collision.",
   "conf": 0.9968,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    105.6,
    259.5,
    523.9,
    274.2
   ],
   "text": "4.3.10. On October 26, 2018, at approximately 0930, the mate on the PROWLER was",
   "conf": 0.9966,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    142.2,
    274.6,
    531.5,
    288.2
   ],
   "text": "relieved of his navigation watch and deck duties. He went below to rest until he",
   "conf": 0.9885,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    142.2,
    289.4,
    521.2,
    304.2
   ],
   "text": "got up at 1600 when the vessel was preparing to get underway to head back to",
   "conf": 0.9971,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    141.8,
    304.6,
    194.4,
    318.2
   ],
   "text": "homeport.",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    105.6,
    326.9,
    530.7,
    340.5
   ],
   "text": "4.3.11. The master of the ATTESSA IV reported that he slept from October 25, 2018 at",
   "conf": 0.9913,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    142.2,
    341.3,
    525.5,
    355.7
   ],
   "text": "2100 to October 26 at 0600. He worked most of the day on October 26, but got",
   "conf": 0.9951,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    142.2,
    356.9,
    423.9,
    370.1
   ],
   "text": "about one hour of sleep prior to getting underway at 1800.",
   "conf": 0.9887,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    105.6,
    378.8,
    537.9,
    392.8
   ],
   "text": "4.3.12. Neither vessel made an attempt to hail the other vessel via VHF Radio or produce",
   "conf": 0.9932,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    142.2,
    394.0,
    311.6,
    407.2
   ],
   "text": "a sound signal to prevent collision.",
   "conf": 0.9992,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    105.6,
    416.4,
    498.4,
    429.9
   ],
   "text": "4.3.13. Cell phone records were obtained for both vessel operators. There was no",
   "conf": 0.9871,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    141.8,
    431.1,
    536.3,
    445.5
   ],
   "text": "evidence that either operator was distracted by their phones prior to or at the time",
   "conf": 0.9859,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    142.2,
    446.3,
    219.1,
    458.3
   ],
   "text": "of the collision.",
   "conf": 0.9991,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    105.2,
    467.9,
    529.9,
    482.6
   ],
   "text": "4.3.14. The ATTESSA IV was equipped with video surveillance aboard the vessel. The",
   "conf": 0.996,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    141.8,
    483.0,
    539.5,
    497.0
   ],
   "text": "video evidence provided post-casualty indicated that the PROWLER's deck lights",
   "conf": 0.9952,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    142.6,
    498.6,
    359.0,
    510.6
   ],
   "text": "were on and the vessel was well illuminated.",
   "conf": 0.996,
